
# A/B: вариант A (2.1.0) — всем, вариант B (2.2.0) — аудитории с заголовком X-User-Group: beta
$ kubectl apply -k k8s/strategies/ab-testing
service/taskflow-a created
service/taskflow-b created
deployment.apps/taskflow-a created
deployment.apps/taskflow-b created
httproute.gateway.networking.k8s.io/taskflow created
$ kubectl -n taskflow-deploy get pods -l strategy=ab-testing -o custom-columns=POD:.metadata.name,TRACK:.metadata.labels.track,IMAGE:.spec.containers[0].image,READY:.status.containerStatuses[0].ready,STATUS:.status.phase
POD                           TRACK   IMAGE            READY   STATUS
taskflow-a-7c888c7fd7-fwgbb   a       taskflow:2.1.0   true    Running
taskflow-a-7c888c7fd7-h9ntb   a       taskflow:2.1.0   true    Running
taskflow-b-d9f795977-q9b7d    b       taskflow:2.2.0   true    Running
taskflow-b-d9f795977-vnj26    b       taskflow:2.2.0   true    Running
$ kubectl -n taskflow-deploy get httproute taskflow -o jsonpath='{range .spec.rules[*]}match={.matches[0].headers}  →  {.backendRefs[0].name}{"\n"}{end}'
match=[{"name":"X-User-Group","type":"Exact","value":"beta"}]  →  taskflow-b
match=  →  taskflow-a

# Один и тот же запрос — разные варианты в зависимости от аудитории
$ curl -s -H 'Host: taskflow.local' http://127.0.0.1:8888/api/version; echo
{"service":"taskflow","version":"2.1.0","instance":"taskflow-a-7c888c7fd7-fwgbb"}
$ curl -s -H 'Host: taskflow.local' -H 'X-User-Group: beta' http://127.0.0.1:8888/api/version; echo
{"service":"taskflow","version":"2.2.0","instance":"taskflow-b-d9f795977-vnj26"}
$ curl -s -H 'Host: taskflow.local' -H 'X-User-Group: staff' http://127.0.0.1:8888/api/version; echo
{"service":"taskflow","version":"2.1.0","instance":"taskflow-a-7c888c7fd7-fwgbb"}
  Другое значение заголовка (staff) — не beta: вариант A.

